1 NOTE Ahnentafel position 16.
1 NOTE Parents UNKNOWN. Simplício's Armond surname distinguishes him from the Toledo family he married into. PRB-0008 and PRB-0009 (1867 inventários) list a "Simplício José Ferreira de TOLEDO, solteiro, 14 anos" as JC's own son (item 6 in both) — a DIFFERENT person with a Toledo surname who died before 1879. A prior session (7 August 2026) mistakenly identified that Simplício de Toledo with our Simplício Armond and added F-0026 as his birth family; corrected same day. He is Eliza Balbina de Toledo's husband; his biological parents remain unidentified. He is NOT a child of José Cezário de Toledo Lima (P-0054) or Claudina Brandina de Jesus (P-0055).
1 NOTE His name appears in four records: the short "Simplicio Armand" (Aristão's 1957 death, CIV-0005); "Simplício Ferreira Armond" (Marfiza's 1962 death, CIV-0013); and "Simplicio José Ferreira Armond" (the 1881 Toledo heir list PRB-0001 and the 1884 petition PRB-0002) — PRB-0002 bearing his own autograph signature ("Simplicio Joze Ferr.a Armond"). The owner confirms his full name is "Simplício José Ferreira Armond", set as the preferred name on 2026-07-30 — it matches his autograph signature and the two 1880s probate records; the shorter source forms ("Simplicio Armand", "Simplício Ferreira Armond") are preserved as variants.
