1 TITL Marriage certificate of Geraldo Paz Armond and Cidalia Engracio Guimarães
1 TEXT A damaged civil marriage certificate (Casamento nº 898, Eugenópolis, livro 13-B) recording the 31 May 1952 marriage of Geraldo Paz Armond (born Limeira, MG, 30 January 1915, padeiro) and Cidalia Engracio Guimarães (born Alvorada, MG, 15 September 1930, doméstica; thereafter signing "Cidalia Engrácio Armond"). A clearer alternate view (2026-07-30 retrieval sync) resolves the previously obscured lines: Geraldo's mother is D. Liliosa Paz, "nascida aqui" (Eugenópolis), "falecida em 16-4-946"; Cidalia's parents are Antônio Engrácio de Souza (born 15 June 1894) and D. Maria Aurora Guimarães (born 1 January 1904).
