1 NOTE Transcription: [Certification header band, bilingual English/French, with the Ontario coat of arms:] Ontario — Office of the Registrar General / Bureau du registraire général Certified A True Photostatic Print of a Record — Photocopie certifiée conforme d'un document on file at the Office of the Registrar General Ontario, Canada — se trouvant dans les dossiers du Bureau du registraire général (Ontario) Canada Registration Number: / Numéro d'enregistrement : 2003 040425 — PAGE 1 of 1 Certificate number: / Numéro du certificat : P 026742 Date issued: / Date de délivrance : Jan 13 2005 File number: / Numéro de dossier : 04406366-01-3 [Registered form:] Ministry of Consumer and Business Services / Office of the Register General [sic] Marriage Licence [Ontario logo] This form is a permanent legal document and can only be used to register a marriage that takes place in Ontario. Please PRINT clearly in blue or black ink. Licence number: E250832 Part 1 To be completed by the office issuing this licence 1. Date this licence was issued (d/m/y): 07/07/2003 2. Municipality where licence was issued: City of Toronto 3. Name of licence issuer or deputy issuer: Irena Kuznik-Perez 4. Signature of licence issuer or deputy issuer: [signed] J.K. [flourish] 5. Proposed place of marriage (town/city): Toronto 6. Proposed date of marriage (d/m/y) (must be within 3 months of date of issue): 16/08/2003 Part 2 Marriage Affidavit (Form 4) — Information about the groom | Information about the bride 7. Last name: Armond 8. First and middle names: Juan Carlos Muniz 9. Marital status: [X] never married [ ] widowed [ ] divorced If divorced in Canada, please provide the court file number. 10. Court file number: [blank] City divorce granted in: [blank] 11. Religious denomination: Protestant | 12. Age: 21 | Date of birth (d/m/y): 22/06/1982 13. Province where groom was born (if outside Canada, state the country): Brazil 14. Father's name (last, first): Armond, Luis Carlos Igracio 15. Mother's name (last name before marriage, first name): Muniz, Lucinea A. 16. Province where the groom's father was born (if outside Canada, state the country): Brazil 17. Province where the groom's mother was born (if outside Canada, state the country): Brazil 24. Last legal name before this marriage: Bevilacqua 25. First and middle names: Vanessa Araujo 26. Marital status: [X] never married [ ] widowed [ ] divorced If divorced in Canada, please provide the court file number. 27. Court file number: [blank] City divorce granted in: [blank] 28. Religious denomination: Protestant | 29. Age: 22 | Date of birth (d/m/y): 15/11/1980 30. Province where bride was born (if outside Canada, state the country): Brazil 31. Father's name (last, first): Bevilacqua, Vanderlei 32. Mother's name (last name before marriage, first name): Araujo, Walkiria 33. Province where the bride's father was born (if outside Canada, state the country): Brazil 34. Province where the bride's mother was born (if outside Canada, state the country): Brazil 18. Name in full of applicant: Juan Carlos Muniz Armond and [Name in full of joint applicant]: Vanessa Araujo Bevilacqua make oath and say as follows: That I believe there is no affinity, consanguinity, prior marriage or other lawful cause or legal impediment to bar or hinder the solemnization of the marriage, and that the contents set forth herein are to the best of Our [handwritten insertion] (my or our) knowledge, information and belief, true in every particular: Sworn/affirmed before me at City of Toronto (day or city) in the Province of Ontario this 7th day of July, 2003 (year) Signature of issuer/deputy issuer: J.K. [signed] (Signature of applicant) [signed] (Signature of joint applicant) [signed] 19. Present address of groom (street number and name): 1128 Dufferin St. | Apartment: 2 Floor 20. City or town: Toronto | 21. Province: Ontario 22. Postal code: M6H4B6 | 23. Telephone number: (416) 419-0905 35. Present address of bride (street number and name): 73 Yarmounth Rd. | Apartment: [blank] 36. City or town: Toronto | 37. Province: Ontario 38. Postal code: M6G1X1 | 39. Telephone number: (416) 538-4331 Part 3 Statement of marriage - to be completed following the marriage ceremony (Form 7) 40. Place of marriage (name the city or town and the county, regional municipality or district): TORONTO, ON [handwritten] 41. Date of marriage (d/m/y): 16-08-2003 [handwritten] 42. Signature of groom: X [signed] 43. Signature of bride: X [signed] 44. Signature of witness: X [signed, illegible] 45. Signature of witness: X [signed, illegible] By signing below, I certify that the marriage of the bride and groom named in this marriage licence was performed on the date and at the place indicated above. 46. Signature of person who performed marriage: [signed] 47. Date (d/m/y): 16 OF August OF 2003 [handwritten, as written] Please print clearly in blue or black ink. 48. Name of person who performed marriage (last, first, middle): WAGNER DA COSTA [handwritten] 49. Your status: [X] Clergy [ ] Judge [ ] Justice of the peace [ ] Other 50. Address of person who performed marriage: 8 GADE DR. TORONTO ON. M3M·2K3 [handwritten; street name uncertain: GADE] 51. Telephone number: (416) 631-0503 [handwritten] 52. Your registration number: [handwritten, uncertain: 52880 or 528880] 53. Your denomination (clergy only): ASSEMBLY OF GOD [handwritten] For use of the Registrar General only: I am satisfied to the correctness of this statement and register this marriage Signature: Judith M. Hartman [signed] Date (d/m/y): SEP 1 5 2003 [date stamp] Personal information contained in this form is collected under the authority of the Marriage Act, R.S.O. 1990, c.M.3 and will be used to determine whether to issue the marriage licence, to register the marriage, provide certified copies, extracts, certificates, search notices, photocopies and for statistical, research, medical, law enforcement, adoption and adoption disclosure purposes. Questions about this collection should be directed to the Deputy Registrar General at P.O. Box 4600, Thunder Bay, ON P7B 6L8. Telephone 1-800-461-2156 or 416-325-8305 [last digits of area code uncertain] 11005 (10/01)
