1 TITL Civil birth registration of Alberto Bohrer (1890), naming his parents Joaquim José Bohrer and Lucinda Ferreira da Silva Bohrer and both grandparent couples
1 TEXT 1890 Nova Friburgo civil birth of Alberto Bohrer, declared by his paternal uncle Guilherme Samuel Bohrer because the father was absent. It names the parents Joaquim José Bohrer (P-0030, negociante, "natural desta Freguezia") and Lucinda Ferreira da Silva Bohrer (P-0031, "natural desta Freguezia"), states they were married in the Igreja Matriz of Nova Friburgo, and names both grandparent couples: paternal Francisco José Bohrer (deceased) + Roza Eugenia de Lemos, and maternal Antonio da Silva Ferreira + Maria Joanna da Silva Ferreira.
