1 TITL Civil marriage (inteiro teor) of João Rodrigues Braga and Aristides Ferreira Armand (1894, Boa Família, Muriaé), naming her parents Simplício José Ferreira Armand and Elisa Balbina de Jesus
1 TEXT A 2019 certified inteiro-teor of the 11 August 1894 civil marriage of João Rodrigues Braga and Dona Aristides Ferreira Armand at São Fernando do Divisório, Boa Família (Muriaé, MG) — held at the house of Simplício José Ferreira Armand, who also signed as a witness. The bride, aged 19 (so born c.1875, "natural do Rio Pardo da Leopoldina"), is recorded as the legitimate daughter of Simplício José Ferreira Armand (P-0016) and Dª Elisa Balbina de Jesus (P-0017) — a third documented child of that couple and a sister of Aristão (P-0008) and Marfiza.
