1 TITL Marriage provision for João Monis Bittencourt and Susanna Rita Brondão
1 TEXT On 23 December 1882 an ecclesiastical provision register of the Court of Rio de Janeiro recorded that a provision was issued for João Monis Bittencourt and Susanna Rita Brondão to marry in the mother church (matriz) of the Santo Antônio de Sapucaia parish. Sapucaia was an established freguesia from 1871, and this destination is consistent with their son Deocleciano being born in Sapucaia (CIV-0001). The entry establishes the intended couple and parish but does not state that the marriage ceremony had already occurred.
1 REPO @REPO0002@
