1 TITL Parish marriage register entry of Deocleciano Muniz Bittencourt and Luiza Fernandes de Azevedo (1916, Santa Luzia de Carangola), naming both couples' parents
1 TEXT The original 1916 parish (religious) marriage of Deocleciano Muniz Bittencourt (P-0012) and Luiza Fernandes de Azevedo (P-0013) at Santa Luzia de Carangola, 21 October 1916 — the same union as the civil record (CIV-0001, same date). It names Deocleciano (24, born and baptized in Sapucaia RJ; son of João Muniz Bittencourt P-0019 and Suzana Rita Brandão P-0020) and Luiza (18, born and baptized in Bom Jesus de Cachoeira Alegre; daughter of Secundino Maria de Azevedo P-0038 and Thereza Fernandes de Azevedo P-0039). Primary confirmation of Luiza's parents, and it settles the flagged CIV-0006 "Sebastião" misread — her father is Secundino (Maria) de Azevedo.
