1 TITL Parish marriage register entry of Nestor Lopes Barbosa and Joventina Muniz Bittencourt (1916, Santa Luzia de Carangola)
1 TEXT The original 1916 parish marriage of Nestor Lopes Barbosa and Joventina Muniz Bittencourt at Santa Luzia de Carangola, 21 October 1916. Joventina (17, born and baptized in the Carangola parish) is a legitimate daughter of João Muniz Bittencourt (P-0019) and Suzana Rita Brandão (P-0020) — hence a sister of Deocleciano (P-0012), recorded as a documented child on F-0007. That she was born ~1899 in Carangola (while Deocleciano was born 1892 in Sapucaia) dates the family's move from Sapucaia (RJ) to Carangola (MG) to between 1892 and ~1899.
