1 TITL 1787 Barbacena baptism of Ladisláo, son of Joaquim José Ferreira de Toledo and Ritta Angélica Rodrigues — confirming Ladisláo Egídio Ferreira de Toledo's parents
1 TEXT The 9 September 1787 Barbacena baptism of a child (read as Ladisláo) — legitimate son of [Joaquim] José Ferreira de Toledo (P-0057) and Dona Ritta Angélica Rodrigues (P-0058). This is the connecting record that establishes Ladisláo Egídio Ferreira de Toledo (P-0056) as their son, upgrading the F-0028 parentage edge from strong-evidence to confirmed. The parents and the 9 September 1787 date are clearly legible on the image-recovered scan; the child's own forename is faded and rests on the index identification (the couple's 9-Sep-1787 baptism) plus the corroborating 1821 Barbacena baptism of Ladisláo × Matilde's daughter Carolina (PAR-0017).
