1 TEXT Parish baptism entry Nº 5 for a child named João, born on the 24th of an illegible month of 1845 (day and year legible; month illegible), in the freguesia of Nossa Senhora Mãe de Deus, Povoação, Ilha de São Miguel (Açores). His parents are named as Manoel [Muniz?] Byttancourt and Francisca Roza do Espirito Santo. The entry is a joint baptism ("foram baptizados em o mesmo dia"); the sibling baptised on the same day is identified by the retrieval agent as Manoel. The paternal grandparents are partially legible in the entry as João [?] and Maria [?] de [?], consistent with P-0048 (João Muniz Bytancourt) and P-0049 (Maria Jacintha de Medeiros). Godparents: Antonio [?] Salinas and Claudino [?]. Signed by the vicar and witnesses including João Jacinto [Botelho?] de Bulhões and Padre Augusto Pacheco [?].
