1 TITL Parish marriage of Ladisláo Egídio Ferreira de Toledo and Mathilde Maria de Jesus (8 May 1810, São João del Rei matriz), naming both parents' sets
1 TEXT Marriage on 8 May 1810 at the São João del Rei matriz of Ladisláo Egídio Ferreira de Toledo (P-0056), son of Cap. Joaquim José Ferreira de Toledo (P-0057) and D. Ritta Angélica Rodrigues (P-0058), with Mathilde Maria de Jesus (P-0027), daughter of Alferes Amaro da Silva Xavier (P-0059) and Ignez Francisca de Lima (P-0060). Both spouses are stated to be born and baptised in the Freguesia de Barbacena (naturais e batizados). This record is the primary source for Matilde's parentage and the primary confirmation of this marriage; it also supplies a second attestation of Ladisláo's parentage (already confirmed by his 1787 baptism, PAR-0019). The negative result in the Barbacena Piedade marriage books (1793–1826) is explained by the couple marrying at São João del Rei rather than in either spouse's home parish.
