1 TITL Parish marriage of Manoel Muniz Byttancourt and Francisca Roza do Espírito Santo (1 February 1845, Nossa Senhora Mãe de Deus, Povoação, São Miguel)
1 TEXT Marriage on 1 February 1845 at Nossa Senhora Mãe de Deus, Povoação, São Miguel, of Manoel Muniz Byttancourt (P-0042) and Francisca Roza do Espírito Santo (P-0047). The marriage date is exactly nine months before their son João's birth on 24 October 1845 (PAR-0022), consistent with timing. Re-read 2026-08-07 from enhanced image crops: the groom's father tentatively reads as "António [surname illegible]"; the bride's father tentatively reads as "Manuel Joaquim [surname illegible]" — revising the earlier hypothesis of "J" initial / "José Pacheco" for the bride's father. A witness signature reads "M.to António José [Pacheco?]". Parent surnames remain unconfirmed; the BPARPD watermark obscures the body text. The act is fully contained in folio 73r; folio 73v is a second unrelated marriage of the same date.
