1 TITL Certified ecclesiastical transcript of the 1838 baptism of Carolina, daughter of Capitão Cezário José da Silva Lima and Dona Joanna Umbelina de Jesus (São José del-Rei), confirming Amaro da Silva Xavier × Ignez Francisca de Lima as paternal grandparents
1 TEXT Typed 2019 ecclesiastical certified copy of the baptism (8 October 1838) of Carolina, born 28 February 1838, legitimate daughter of Capitão Cezário José da Silva Lima and Dona Joanna Umbelina de Jesus, at the Matriz de Santo Antônio da Villa de São José (São José del-Rei, today Tiradentes). The entry directly names "Capitão Amaro da Silva Xavier" (P-0059) and "Dona Ignez Francisca de Lima" (P-0060) as the paternal grandparents of Carolina, independently corroborating the Amaro × Ignez union (F-0029) established by PAR-0023 and PAR-0025. Capitão Cezário José da Silva Lima is a confirmed son of Amaro × Ignez (collateral; added as documented_child on F-0029). He is the same person who appears as a witness ("Furriel Cezário José da Silva Lima") at the 1810 Ladisláo × Mathilde marriage (PAR-0023).
