1 TITL Erschwil (Solothurn) Catholic parish baptism register, church book #68, 1760 — baptism of Elisabetha Borer (17 June 1760), daughter of Joseph Borer and Anna Maria Borer
1 TEXT Erschwil (Erischwyg, Solothurn) Catholic parish baptism register, church book #68, records the baptism of "Ecisabeth" [Elisabetha] Borer on 17 June 1760. Her parents are named as "Joseph Borer fusemnistr" (P-0076) and "anna Maria Borer" (P-0077). This is PRIMARY evidence for the birth date and parentage of Elisabetha Borer (P-0073), who later married Johann Jacob Wehrli (P-0072) in Grindel on 27 January 1782. The godfather is "Joseph Borer gmüpl" and godmother "Mari Elisabth Borr fallend" — likely kin within the Borer family network of the Solothurn district.
