1 TITL 1881 Leopoldina probate heir list naming the Toledo siblings, including Eliza Balbina de Toledo (wife of Simplício José Ferreira Armond)
1 TEXT A page from an 1881 Leopoldina probate/partilha listing the heirs of an estate on Eliza Balbina de Toledo's side. It names Eliza Balbina de Toledo as the wife of Simplício José Ferreira Armond and lists her Toledo siblings with ages: Maria Bulandina de Toledo (m. Manoel Marques Jorge), Ladisláo Egydio Ferreira de Toledo (~23, b. ~1858), Geraldo Augusto de Toledo Lima (~15, b. ~1866, then living in Rio de Janeiro), and Josepha Olympia da Paixão (~12, b. ~1869), plus a predeceased Carolina Leopoldina Marques inheriting by representation. The companion 1884 petition (PRB-0002) names the decedent as D. Mathilde Maria de Jezus.
