1 TITL Imigrantes de Nova Friburgo — genealogias: BORER I, BORER II, WEHRLI sections (Henrique Bon compiler)
1 TEXT Genealogical compilation for Nova Friburgo Swiss-German immigrant families. Pp.300-301 cover BORER I (Jacob Borer b.1801 Erschwil — Francisco José Bohrer's line) and BORER II (Laurent Borer b.1797 Grindel — Valentim Martinho Bohrer's line). Pp.302-303 cover BORER III (unrelated Johann Borer b.1792 Erschwil line). The Casa Suíça database entries and WEHRLI section document Johann Jacob Wehrli × Elisabetha Borer as the parents of Anna Maria Werhly, Laurent's wife, with primary confirmation of their 1782 Grindel marriage from the Swiss parish register (image rec-bohrer-werly-borer-marriages-grindel-1780.jpg, entry 4, page 71).
